    <h2>Spaghetti</h2>
    <h4>Ingredients</h4>
    <ul>
        <li>Spaghetti pasta</li>
        <li>Tomatoes</li>
        <li>Garlic</li>
        <li>Beef meat</li>
        <li>Olive oil</li>
    </ul>
    <h4>Steps</h4>
    <ol>
        <li>Boil water in a pot and cook the spaghetti until al dente.</li>
        <li>In a separate pan, heat olive oil and sauté minced garlic.</li>
        <li>Add beef meat and cook until browned.</li>
        <li>Add tomatoes and simmer for 15-20 minutes to make the sauce.</li>
        <li>Drain spaghetti and mix with the sauce.</li>
    </ol>
    <h4>Tips</h4>
    <p>
        You can add some vegetables, like onions or bell peppers. <br>
        You can also add some spices, like pepper or oregano. <br>
        You can also add some cheese on top, like parmesan. <br>
        You can also add fresh basil for extra flavor. <br>
    </p>
    <h4>You've prepared a delicious spaghetti! Enjoy your meal!</h4>
